ishing sword supplies ER; its Skill CRIT bonus is not a substitute for EM or Favonius team particles. Use when ER is the priority and other swords are unavailable."}],"a":[{"names":["Viridescent Venerer"],"text":"Core support set: boosts Swirl and reduces Swirled Pyro/Hydro/Electro/Cryo RES by 40%.","stats":"EM or ER · EM · EM"},{"names":["Instructor"],"text":"Budget 4-star support option: an on-field reaction gives teammates 120 EM for 8 seconds.","stats":"EM or ER · EM · EM"},{"names":["Thundering Fury"],"text":"Specialized on-field Aggravate/Electro-Charged setups can reduce Skill cooldown through reactions. Not standard support.","stats":"EM or ER · EM · EM"}],"t":[{"name":"Hydro Hurricane","members":["Kaedehara Kazuha","Neuvillette","Furina","Xilonen"],"text":"Kazuha groups foes and buffs Hydro with Swirl/VV; Furina boosts damage and Xilonen adds healing, buffs, and RES Shred.","roles":["Anemo Buff","Main DPS","Hydro Buff","Healer / Shred"]},{"name":"Emberleaf Waltz","members":["Kaedehara Kazuha","Arlecchino","Xingqiu","Bennett"],"text":"Kazuha shreds and buffs Pyro for Arlecchino; Xingqiu enables Vaporize and Bennett boosts ATK. Avoid unwanted Hydro absorption.","roles":["Buffer / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Thunder in the Leaves","members":["Kaedehara Kazuha","Keqing","Fischl","Yaoyao"],"text":"Yaoyao sustains Quicken; Kazuha buffs and shreds Electro, while Keqing and Fischl trigger Aggravate.","roles":["Buffer / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Healer / Dendro Enabler"]},{"name":"Budget Leaf Blower","members":["Kaedehara Kazuha","Xiangling","Xingqiu","Bennett"],"text":"Accessible National core: Xingqiu enables Vaporize, Bennett powers Xiangling, and Kazuha groups and shreds Pyro/Hydro RES.","roles":["Buffer / Debuffer","Off-field DPS / Pyro Enabler","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Healer / Buffer"]}],"v":"Full EM Buffer: 4pc Viridescent Venerer, EM/EM/EM, and Freedom-Sworn or Iron 